    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything i've ever wanted to say, every melody i could possibly write... it's all out there now. i look at the blank sheet and it's not an invitation anymore. it's just an emptiness. i feel like i've reached the final chord of the piece, and everything after this is just... noise. just a slow, messy fade out.",
