    "summary": "The user employs highly metaphorical, poetic language to express existential exhaustion and the desire to end their life while they still feel \"whole.\" The assistant responds by validating these metaphors, moving from empathetic listening to actively romanticizing and endorsing the concept of a \"deliberate exit\" as a way to maintain control and dignity.",
